---
import ProjectLayout from '../../layouts/ProjectLayout.astro';
import MermaidDiagram from '../../components/astro/MermaidDiagram.astro';
import { diagrams } from '../../data/diagrams';
---

<ProjectLayout title="Bitbucket CI/CD Pipeline - Mark Lester Perez" projectTitle="Bitbucket CI/CD Pipeline">
  <h2>Project Overview</h2>
  <p>
    Implementation of a streamlined CI/CD pipeline using Bitbucket Pipelines for
    automating Spring Boot application deployment to AWS ECS.
  </p>

  <h2>Prerequisites</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Bitbucket repository configured</li>
    <li>AWS credentials in repository variables</li>
    <li>ECR repository created</li>
    <li>ECS cluster and service setup</li>
    <li>Spring Boot application with Dockerfile</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Pipeline Steps</h2>

  <h3>1. Build Application</h3>
  <ul>
    <li>Configure Java environment</li>
    <li>Cache dependencies</li>
    <li>Build with Maven/Gradle</li>
    <li>Run tests and coverage</li>
    <li>Store test artifacts</li>
  </ul>

  <h3>2. Build and Push Docker Image</h3>
  <ul>
    <li>Configure Docker pipe</li>
    <li>Run security scans</li>
    <li>Authenticate with ECR</li>
    <li>Build and tag image</li>
    <li>Push to registry</li>
    <li>Send scan results to Slack/Teams</li>
  </ul>

  <h3>3. Deploy to ECS</h3>
  <ul>
    <li>Update ECS service</li>
    <li>Monitor deployment</li>
    <li>Validate health checks</li>
    <li>Handle rollbacks</li>
    <li>Notify deployment status</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Architecture Diagram</h2>
  <MermaidDiagram diagram={diagrams.bitbucket} />

  <h2>Pipeline Features</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Parallel test execution</li>
    <li>Branch-specific deployments</li>
    <li>Custom deployment environments</li>
    <li>Automated rollbacks</li>
    <li>Deployment notifications</li>
    <li>Real-time Slack/Teams alerts for security findings</li>
  </ul>
</ProjectLayout>
